description.en:
Like `mouseMoved()` for knobs:

```js
function knobMoved(n, value) {
  // knob n is now at value
}
```

It is called for every step the knob sends, so many times per second while it turns. To read a knob once a frame, use [`knob1`](#knob1) instead.

description.zh:
就像旋鈕版的 `mouseMoved()`：

```js
function knobMoved(n, value) {
  // 旋鈕 n 現在在 value
}
```

旋鈕每送出一格就呼叫一次，轉動的時候每秒會呼叫很多次。想要每個畫面讀一次，就改用 [`knob1`](#knob1)。

