description.en:
Declare it the way you declare `keyPressed()`:

```js
function notePressed(note, velocity) {
  // a key went down
}
```

It is called once per key, with the key and how hard. A pad also calls it, unless the sketch defines [`padPressed()`](#padPressed).

description.zh:
用宣告 `keyPressed()` 的方式宣告它：

```js
function notePressed(note, velocity) {
  // 有一個鍵按下去了
}
```

每個鍵呼叫一次，帶著是哪個鍵、多用力。打擊墊也會呼叫它，除非草圖有定義 [`padPressed()`](#padPressed)。

examples.code:
