  fill(random(255), random(255), random(255), 200);
  circle(map(note, 36, 96, 20, width - 20), height / 2, 10 + velocity * 120);
}

description.en:
The partner of [`notePressed()`](#notePressed), like `keyReleased()` to `keyPressed()`:

```js
function noteReleased(note) {
  // a key came up
}
```

description.zh:
[`notePressed()`](#notePressed) 的另一半，就像 `keyReleased()` 之於 `keyPressed()`：

```js
function noteReleased(note) {
  // 有一個鍵放開了
}
```

