description.en:
```js
function padPressed(n, velocity) {
  // pad n was hit
}
```

When the sketch defines `padPressed()`, a pad calls it and **not** [`notePressed()`](#notePressed); without it, a pad calls `notePressed()` like any key.

description.zh:
```js
function padPressed(n, velocity) {
  // 墊子 n 被打了一下
}
```

草圖有定義 `padPressed()` 的話，打擊墊會呼叫它，而**不會**呼叫 [`notePressed()`](#notePressed)；沒有定義的話，打擊墊會像任何一個鍵一樣呼叫 `notePressed()`。

