description.en:
Declare it the way you declare `keyPressed()`:

```js
function beatDetected(level) {
  // flash, spawn, jump to the next scene
}
```

It is called once per beat, right when the beat lands, not once per frame. Use [`beat`](#beat) instead if you would rather ask each frame.

description.zh:
用宣告 `keyPressed()` 的方式宣告它：

```js
function beatDetected(level) {
  // 閃一下、生出東西、跳到下一個場景
}
```

每個拍子呼叫一次，在拍子落下的當下，不是每個畫面一次。如果你比較想每個畫面自己問，改用 [`beat`](#beat)。

examples.code:
let flash = 0;

function setup() {
  createCanvas(400, 300);
}

function beatDetected(level) {
  flash = 0.4 + level * 0.6;   // louder beat, brighter flash
}

function draw() {
  background(20 + flash * 200);
  flash *= 0.9;
}

